o utility functions\n- No hooks\n- No styles/CSS\n- No HTML entry point\n- No main application file (e.g., `main.tsx`, `App.tsx`)\n\n---\n\n### 3. Configuration Files Status\n\n**Current State: NO CONFIGURATION FILES**\n\n**Completely Missing Configuration Files:**\n- ❌ `package.json` - NPM/Node.js dependencies\n- ❌ `tsconfig.json` - TypeScript configuration\n- ❌ `vite.config.ts` - Vite build tool configuration\n- ❌ `.eslintrc.*` - ESLint linting rules\n- ❌ `.prettierrc.*` - Prettier formatting rules\n- ❌ `.gitignore` - Git ignore patterns\n- ❌ `index.html` - HTML entry point\n- ❌ `postcss.config.js` - PostCSS configuration\n- ❌ `tailwind.config.js` - If using Tailwind CSS\n- ❌ `.env.*` - Environment variables\n- ❌ `vitest.config.ts` - Testing configuration (if using Vitest)\n- ❌ `playwright.config.ts` - Playwright testing configuration\n\n---\n\n### 4. Testing Framework Status\n\n**Current State: NO TESTS OR TESTING FRAMEWORK**\n\n**Missing:**\n- ❌ Test files (`.test.ts`, `.spec.ts`, etc.)\n- ❌ Testing framework configuration\n- ❌ Test fixtures\n- ❌ Test utilities\n- ❌ Coverage reports\n\n**No testing setup detected.** The AGENTS.md file mentions using `playwright-cli` to test features in the browser, but Playwright is not configured.\n\n---\n\n### 5. Current Project Structure\n\n**Directory Tree:**\n```\ngame_of_life/                    # 572KB total size\n├── .git/                        # Git repository (324KB)\n│   ├── hooks/                   # Git hooks (64KB)\n│   ├── objects/                 # Git objects (212KB)\n│   ├── refs/                    # Git references\n│   └── config                   # Git configuration\n├── src/                         # Source code (0 files - EMPTY)\n│   └── lib/                     # Library utilities (0 files - EMPTY)\n├── specs/                       # Specifications (60KB, 14 files)\n│   ├── audio-sonification.md\n│   ├── auto-advance-transitions.md\n│   ├── canvas-rendering.md\n│   ├── expert-settings.md\n│   ├── flux-management.md\n│   ├── grid-interaction.md\n│   ├── level-progression.md\n│   ├── movement-detection.md\n│   ├── phase-management.md\n│   ├── scoring-system.md\n│   ├── simulation-engine.md\n│   ├── ui-overlay.md\n│   └── user-interaction.md\n├── AGENTS.md                    # Agent testing instructions\n├── IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md        # Detailed implementation plan\n├── PROMPT_build.md              # Build prompt for opencode\n├── PROMPT_plan.md               # Planning prompt for opencode\n├── loop.sh                      # Shell script for automation\n└── opencode_output.log          # Development log (136KB)\n```\n\n---\n\n### 6. Git Status\n\n- **Branch:** `main`\n- **Remote:** `https://github.com/ochanomizu21/game_of_life_game.git`\n- **Commits:** 1 commit (Initial commit: `97dbb89`)\n- **Tags:** None (no version tags exist)\n- **Status:** Unstaged changes to `opencode_output.log`\n\n---\n\n### 7. What IS Present (Documentation & Planning)\n\n**Specification Files (14 detailed specs):**\n1. **simulation-engine.md** - Core Game of Life rules, toroidal boundaries, age tracking\n2. **canvas-rendering.md** - Dark neon theme, age-based colors, glow effects, DPR scaling\n3. **phase-management.md** - PLANNING/COUNTDOWN/RUNNING/FINISHED state machine\n4. **flux-management.md** - Resource system for strategic cell placement\n5. **grid-interaction.md** - Click-to-place/erase, drag-to-draw, cell animations\n6. **user-interaction.md** - Mouse and touch event handling, coordinate mapping\n7. **audio-sonification.md** - Web Audio API, generation sounds, interaction sounds\n8. **scoring-system.md** - Movement detection (movers/oscillators), point calculation\n9. **level-progression.md** - Level configurations, difficulty scaling\n10. **auto-advance-transitions.md** - Fade transitions, interstitial screens\n11. **ui-overlay.md** - Glass HUD, controls, settings panel\n12. **expert-settings.md** - Advanced parameter tuning, presets\n13. **movement-detection.md** - Connected component detection, centroid tracking\n14. **level-progression.md** - Level system and progression\n\n**Implementation Plan (IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md - 926 lines):**\n- 6 sprints planned (Foundation, Core Mechanics, Progression, Audio/Polish, Expert Features, QA)\n- Detailed task breakdown with dependencies\n- Prioritized tasks (CRITICAL → HIGH → MEDIUM → LOW)\n- Parallel development tracks outlined\n- Framework decisions: React + Vite recommended\n\n---\n\n### 8. Project Overview\n\n**Game Concept:**\n- Conway's Game of Life with strategic resource management\n- Players place cells using limited \"Flux\" resources\n- Age-based neon color rendering (cyan → blue → magenta → purple)\n- Phase-based gameplay: PLANNING → COUNTDOWN → RUNNING → FINISHED\n- Level progression with scoring system\n- Movers, oscillators, and static patterns detected for scoring\n\n**Recommended Tech Stack (per IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md):**\n- Framework: React\n- Build Tool: Vite\n- Language: TypeScript\n- State Management: React hooks (useState, useReducer, useRef)\n- Styling: CSS modules or vanilla CSS with CSS variables\n- Testing: Vitest (recommended)\n- Rendering: HTML5 Canvas\n\n---\n\n### Summary\n\n**This is a brand new project with ONLY documentation and planning.**\n\n- ✅ **Present:** 14 detailed specification files, comprehensive implementation plan, git repository initialized\n- ❌ **Missing:** ALL source code, configuration files, dependencies, testing framework, build setup\n\n**Next Steps (per IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md - Sprint 1):**\n1. Project Setup & Build System (CRITICAL - FIRST PRIORITY)\n2. Type Definitions (CRITICAL)\n3. Shared Utilities (CRITICAL)\n4. Simulation Engine (CRITICAL)\n5. Phase Management (CRITICAL)\n6. Canvas Rendering (CRITICAL)\n7. User Interaction (CRITICAL)\n8. Flux Management (CRITICAL)\n9. Grid Interaction (CRITICAL - for playable MVP)\n\nThe repository is essentially a blank canvas with excellent planning documentation ready for implementation to begin.\n</task_